  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual material implying personal inadequacy",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'trump can't swing it' as a metaphor for personal inability or failure, even though the text explicitly refers to Donald Trump. The meme's structure invites the user to identify with the implied inadequacy, projecting their own sense of failure or incompetence onto the meme's message. The user is not directly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the metaphorical framing ('can't swing it') creates an implicit projection where the viewer may feel personally connected to the concept of being unable to handle a situation, thus projecting themselves onto the textual material.",
